# Internal service hostnames.
# api.home and ai.home route through Traefik (K3s's bundled ingress
# controller, listening on :80 on every node) to the backend/api Service
# in the cluster - no port needed in the URL anymore, unlike the old
# direct-to-container setup.
# grafana.home still points at the old Docker Compose Grafana on the Pi
# (port 3000) until monitoring is migrated onto the cluster too.
192.168.1.253 api.home
192.168.1.253 ai.home
192.168.1.253 grafana.home
